  "bio": "Ange Pele is a highly skilled neotraditional tattoo artist, known for their extraordinary attention to detail and vivid use of color. Operating out of their private studio, Foxglove, as well as the reputable Cloak and Dagger in London, Ange has become a sought-after talent in the United Kingdom's tattoo scene. Their commitment to maintaining a clean working environment ensures a safe and professional experience for all clients.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: London, England, United Kingdom"
